{"id":"635eb91d8ecbc386","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-holder-continuity.md","title":"Holder Continuity","display":"df-holder-continuity — Holder Continuity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-holder-continuity","aliases":["58-df-holder-continuity"],"display":"df-holder-continuity — Holder Continuity","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-holder-continuity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-holder-continuity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-holder-continuity — Holder Continuity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,d_X,d_Y,f,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(X,Y,d_X,d_Y,f,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\)</span>（度量空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Y^X\">\\(f\\in Y^X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in(0,1]\">\\(\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（此处定义的 Hölder 连续谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}continuity} \\vdash \\mathrm{HolderCont}_S(f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d_X)\\land\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(Y,d_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d_Y(f(x),f(y))\\leq C\\,d_X(x,y)^\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}continuity} \\vdash \\mathrm{HolderCont}_S(f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d_X)\\land\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(Y,d_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d_Y(f(x),f(y))\\leq C\\,d_X(x,y)^\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hölder continuity implies ordinary continuity；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=1\">\\(\\alpha=1\\)</span> 时即 Lipschitz 连续。</li>\n<li>度量是该性质的必要参数；只写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\alpha\">\\(f,\\alpha\\)</span> 会把同一集合上的不同度量混同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S$（度量空间谓词，见 [[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,d_X,d_Y,f,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in(0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}continuity} \\vdash \\mathrm{HolderCont}_S(f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d_X)\\land\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(Y,d_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d_Y(f(x),f(y))\\leq C\\,d_X(x,y)^\\alpha)","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha=1","display":false},{"tex":"f,\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1101,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5a0510b115e1b59","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bfb4dca042a4697a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b681b1b3a348563e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S\\subseteq V^6$ (Hölder 连续谓词, see [[58-df-holder-continuity]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-627","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-holder-continuity.md|58-df-holder-continuity]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["ce876585d129ce97","36d7463d215be751"]}